<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 5-week T-note yields 5.200 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 5-week T-note yields 5.200 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.200	 5.20 only   5.304</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 96)</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   5.090	 5.09 only   5.188</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 93)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   5.050	 5.05 only   5.143</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 100)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
